<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY LEAGUE-BRITAIN BEAT PAPUA NEW GUINEA 32-30.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-BRITAIN BEAT PAPUA NEW GUINEA 32-30.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain beat Papua New Guinea</p>
<p>32-30 (halftime 12-16) in a rugby league test played in Lae on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Britain - Tries: Kris Radlinski (2), Keiron Cunningham,</p>
<p>Bobbie Goulding, Anthony Sullivan. Goals: Goulding (6)</p>
<p>Papua New Guinea - Tries: Ben Bire (2), Stanley Gene, David</p>
<p>Gomia, Adrian Lam, Robert Sio. Goals: Elias Paiyo (3)</p>
</text>
